<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιφρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>firm, solid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1803.1
			</span></i>, al.; of olives, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				141
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					4.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεκτάνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crobyl.
					7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυλὸς σαρκώδης καὶ ς</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				510b28
			</span></i>; of wood, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.11.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.1.11
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαδαρός</span>, of
			flesh, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				531b13
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				735b18
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σομφός</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				732b35
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν βατράχων ᾠὸν στερεὸν
				καὶ ς</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				754a34
			</span></i>; of persons, <i>stout, sturdy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεανίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.Jun.
					<u>Im.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>.—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρυφνός</span> is a
			freq. v.l.</div>
